cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  ioncontrol: reproducibility package for "Falsifying Cyber-Physiological
  Control Concepts: A Reproducible Framework Applied to Metal-Ion Regulation
  in Type 1 Diabetes"
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Berber
    given-names: Elmehdi
  - family-names: Boualem
    given-names: Adda
  - family-names: Daas
    given-names: Samia
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-24
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22090216
repository-code: https://github.com/WaledAmidou/ioncontrol
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a study that identifies a cyber-physiological
  control framework from NHANES 2015-2016 and 2021-2023, evaluates it in
  closed loop, and tests its physiological premise. The control result is
  robust; the physiological premise does not survive endpoint decomposition,
  proxy validation and adiposity adjustment.
keywords:
  - NHANES
  - adaptive control
  - insulin resistance
  - reproducibility
  - falsification
